","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-0__F9fnKt8uioCKztF5Ww","review_id":"pF1BBNKDrQgfxLEOiZsyCg","date":"2018-08-06T14:41:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9344908595085144,"text_excerpt":"I absolutely love this bar! Even though I live in New Orleans, I stayed at the Catahoula last year for a work conference and my team happily convened morning, noon and night here. Delicious coffee drinks in the morning, lovely evening wines and cocktails early evening, and not gonna lie, we might have closed the bar down at least twice when night caps turned into, \"Oh shit, we have to get up bright and early\" (starting the day bright and early was almost a cheerful affair because it meant sipping espresso drinks surrounded by such urbane tropical environs!) That courtyard is a magical place. It's an Instagram paradise, with a 3 story mural, Edison bulb lighting, plenty of tables for you t..."},{"business_id":"-0__F9fnKt8uioCKztF5Ww","review_id":"x8gkKxFVTtRZMjUqVO0cxg","date":"2018-09-07T04:15:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9258019328117371,"text_excerpt":"I was so happy to finally visit when they were open. I usually find my way there a little late and I believe they close at 12 am. The wanderer was an amazing cocktail and recommendation by the bartender. But if the cocktail didn't please you the bartenders Jesse and Wade (I believe that's his name) sure will. They were super pleasant and made me feel so welcome. The space at the hotel is already warm and inviting and those two made me feel as though I was a regular. I tried their vegan version of pork dumplings and they were delicious. If you want to get some fresh air head up to the roof top bar it's a nice space with a decent view."},{"business_id":"-0__F9fnKt8uioCKztF5Ww","review_id":"yCfi_FOFjqvXcIEb6Cgi2w","date":"2019-09-02T22:54:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9235303401947021,"text_excerpt":"Quaint little bar in the Catahoula hotel that specializes in Pisco and craft cocktails. If you don't know which drink you'd like to have, just ask Sean for a recommendation. He's the best! Also don't miss their happy hour specials including their vegan dumplings! I'm not vegan but the food they serve here is bomb!!! You can't go wrong with the cocktails, food or service!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-0__F9fnKt8uioCKztF5Ww","photo_id":"pQC1WC7E2e0VQ4LPX4gqFw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/pQC1WC7E2e0VQ4LPX4gqFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8621900081634521},{"business_id":"-0__F9fnKt8uioCKztF5Ww","photo_id":"1Hk9SCh7PXionemIjLvABw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1Hk9SCh7PXionemIjLvABw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8468453884124756},{"business_id":"-0__F9fnKt8uioCKztF5Ww","photo_id":"zGWdngoiZa3jEMi9SycKvQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/zGWdngoiZa3j